=2 Walkthrough
* Travel to {z:Beadeaux} and enter {z:Qulun Dome} at (H-7) (left after going underground the first time) for a cutscene that starts this quest.
** If you choose not to accept this quest, you will not be given the chance to start it again until the next Conquest Tally.
* Speak to {n:Peshi Yohnts}, {z:Windurst Woods} (H-13) for a cutscene.
* Trade {n:Peshi Yohnts} a {i:Bugard Leather|Bugard Leather|1637}, {i:Turtle Shell|Turtle Shell|885} and 10,000 gil.
* Wait until the next game day to talk to {n:Peshi Yohnts} again who will give you {i:Quadav Parts|Quadav Parts|1866} and instructions on how to craft it into a {i:Quadav Barbut|Quadav Barbut|15201}.
** Zoning is no longer required.
* To synthesize a {i:Quadav Barbut|Quadav Barbut|15201}:

