** {m:Ka'Ghi Trovetaker} ({p:THF})
** {m:Mu'Zha Infernoblade} ({p:RDM})
** {m:No'Bhu Unyielding} ({p:PLD})
** {m:So'Hyu Quakemaker} ({p:BLM})
